    {
      "title": "Function Calling and the Agent Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Function Calling and the Agent Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Tool Definition",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "json",
              "lines": [
                "{\"name\": \"get_order\",",
                " \"description\": \"Get order status by id\",",
                " \"input_schema\": {\"type\": \"object\",",
                " \"properties\": {\"id\": {\"type\": \"integer\"}},",
                " \"required\": [\"id\"]}}"
              ],
              "note": "you send this list of tools with the messages"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Three parts: ==name==, ==description==, ==input_schema==",
                "`description` is the model's main cue for when to use the tool",
                "`input_schema` is JSON Schema: `type` object, `properties`, `required`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. The Tool Call",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Model returns `{type: tool_use, id, name, input}`",
                "`stop_reason` is ==tool_use== when it wants a tool run",
                "The model never executes anything: {red:your code} runs the tool"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Chatbot vs Agent",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Chatbot",
                "Agent"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Model calls",
                  "**one**",
                  "a **loop**"
                ],
                [
                  "Tools",
                  "none needed",
                  "calls, reads results"
                ],
                [
                  "Ends when",
                  "reply is sent",
                  "task is done"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Schema Tips",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==enum== limits a value to allowed choices",
                "Add a `description` to every property",
                "List every needed field in `required`"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Vague schema",
              "text": "A vague schema gives ==wrong or missing arguments==. Constrain it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Agent Loop: Observe, Think, Act",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "The Agent Loop: Observe, Think, Act",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Loop",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Observe",
                    "sub": "messages + latest tool results",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Think",
                    "sub": "model picks next step",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Act",
                    "sub": "emit tool call",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Repeat",
                    "sub": "until no tool call",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Loop ends when the model ==answers without a tool call==",
                "Your code runs the tool; the model only emits `tool_use`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Loop in Code",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "while True:",
                "    resp = model(messages, tools)",
                "    messages.append({\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": resp.content})",
                "    if resp.stop_reason != \"tool_use\": break",
                "    results = [run(b) for b in resp.content if b.type == \"tool_use\"]",
                "    messages.append({\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": results})"
              ],
              "note": "fragment: model, tools and run are yours"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. History Rules",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Reject or break",
              "items": [
                "Append the ==assistant tool_use== message **before** the tool_result message, or the API rejects the turn",
                "Each `tool_result` carries the matching ==tool_use_id==",
                "Parallel calls: return **all** results together in one user message"
              ],
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Stateless model",
              "text": "The full growing message list is ==resent every iteration==, so context and cost grow per step."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tool Results Back into Context",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Tool Results Back into Context",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The tool_result block",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Sent as a ==user-role== message, never assistant",
                "Carries the matching `tool_use_id`",
                "`content` is text or a **JSON string**"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "block = {",
                "  \"type\": \"tool_result\",",
                "  \"tool_use_id\": call.id,",
                "  \"content\": json.dumps(data),",
                "}",
                "messages.append({\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": [block]})"
              ],
              "note": "call site only"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Shape what goes back",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Situation",
                "Do"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Failure",
                  "==is_error: true== plus a useful message, not a crash"
                ],
                [
                  "Large output",
                  "Truncate, paginate or summarize"
                ],
                [
                  "Raw API payload",
                  "Return only fields the model needs"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "A clear error lets the model {green:retry} or {blue:change approach}",
                "A 50k-token dump **bloats** context and degrades reasoning",
                "Unfiltered payloads waste tokens and may ==leak secrets=="
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Output is untrusted",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Web pages and files can hide ==prompt injection== text",
                "It tries to give the model new instructions",
                "Treat it as {red:data}, never as commands"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Result = user-role `tool_result` + matching id. Failures use `is_error`, outputs stay small, and content is untrusted."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "ReAct and Planning",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "ReAct and Planning",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The ReAct Loop",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==ReAct== = **Reason + Act**",
                "Each cycle: thought, action (tool call), observation",
                "Real observations ground the reasoning"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Thought",
                    "sub": "need order status",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Action",
                    "sub": "get_order(id=42)",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Observation",
                    "sub": "shipped",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Thought",
                    "sub": "enough, answer",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Plan-and-Execute vs ReAct",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Plan-and-execute==: write the full step list up front, then run it",
                "Cheaper and more predictable",
                "{red:Brittle} if early steps change the situation"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "ReAct",
                "Plan-and-execute"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Adapts",
                  "step by step",
                  "needs re-plan on failure"
                ],
                [
                  "Calls",
                  "more, can wander",
                  "fewer"
                ],
                [
                  "Shape",
                  "loose",
                  "structured"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Hybrid in Practice",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Draft",
                    "sub": "short plan",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Execute",
                    "sub": "with ReAct",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Check",
                    "sub": "observation contradicts plan?",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Re-plan",
                    "sub": "then continue",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Plan short, act with ReAct, ==re-plan== when an observation contradicts the plan."
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**ReAct vs planning?** Adapts per step vs structured and cheaper",
                "**Why hybrid?** Plan gives direction, observations trigger re-planning"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Stopping Conditions and Tool Permission Safety",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Stopping Conditions and Tool Permission Safety",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. How an Agent Stops",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Natural stop==: reply with no tool call (`stop_reason` is `end_turn`)",
                "**Never rely on it alone**: a confused model may never stop",
                "On a guard hit, return a ==partial result== plus why it stopped"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Hard guard",
                "Typical limit"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Max iterations",
                  "10-25 steps"
                ],
                [
                  "Token or cost budget",
                  "fixed cap per run"
                ],
                [
                  "Wall-clock timeout",
                  "fixed seconds per run"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Detect Loops",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{red:Same tool, same arguments} repeated",
                "{red:No progress} across steps: results add nothing new",
                "Then ==break out== or ask a human for help"
              ],
              "style": "cross"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Tool call",
                    "sub": "name + args",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Seen before?",
                    "sub": "or no progress",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Break out",
                    "sub": "partial result or ask help",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Permissions and Approval",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Least privilege",
              "items": [
                "Only the tools the agent needs",
                "==Read-only== by default",
                "Scoped credentials",
                "**Allowlist**, not denylist"
              ],
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "chain",
              "spec": {
                "title": "Irreversible action (delete, send, pay, deploy)",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "text": "Validate",
                    "note": "args vs schema, server-side",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Human approves",
                    "note": "approval gate",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Run sandboxed",
                    "note": "code execution isolated",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Never trust the model's arguments",
              "text": "Always ==validate server-side==, gate high-impact actions behind a **human**, and sandbox any code the agent runs."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Agent Tool Calling Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Agent Tool Calling Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Loop",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Define tools",
                    "sub": "name, description, schema",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Send",
                    "sub": "messages + tools",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "tool_use",
                    "sub": "stop_reason",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Run tool",
                    "sub": "your code",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Append",
                    "sub": "assistant turn + tool_result",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "end_turn",
                    "sub": "loop stops",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Tool Def and Result Block",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "tool = {",
                "  \"name\": \"get_order\",",
                "  \"description\": \"Look up an order\",",
                "  \"input_schema\": {\"type\": \"object\",",
                "    \"properties\": {\"id\": {\"type\": \"integer\"}},",
                "    \"required\": [\"id\"]}",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "description is the model's cue for when to use it"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "tool_result field",
                "Holds"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`type`",
                  "`tool_result`"
                ],
                [
                  "`tool_use_id`",
                  "id of the matching `tool_use`"
                ],
                [
                  "`content`",
                  "text or JSON string"
                ],
                [
                  "`is_error`",
                  "==true== on failure, so the model can retry"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Guards and Safety",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Max steps==, token or cost ==budget==, wall-clock ==timeout==",
                "==Repeat-call detection==: same tool, same arguments",
                "On a hit, return a partial result with an explanation"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Safety rules",
              "items": [
                "==Least privilege==: only the tools needed, read-only by default",
                "==Allowlist==, not denylist",
                "==Human approval== for destructive actions",
                "Tool output is {red:untrusted}: it may hold prompt injection"
              ],
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Append the assistant `tool_use` turn before the `tool_result`, and never rely on `end_turn` alone to stop."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Check yourself",
      "role": "quiz",
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Check yourself",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "Your loop runs the tool, then appends only a user message holding the tool_result and calls the model again. What happens?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "The API rejects the turn.",
                "The assistant message with the `tool_use` must be appended first, so the result's `tool_use_id` has a match."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A tool's HTTP call returns 404 and your code raises an exception. What should the loop do instead?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "Send a `tool_result` with `is_error` true and a clear message.",
                "The model can then retry or change approach, and the loop keeps running."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "An agent calls `search(\"cats\")` with identical arguments 40 times and never answers. Which guards were missing?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "A max-iterations cap and repeat-call detection.",
                "On a hit, return a partial result with an explanation."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
